      "title": "Welcome to Sekijima Orthodontics",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Serving patients in Renton and the Seattle area — recognized as one of Washington’s top orthodontists by Seattle Met Magazine, we provide the highest-quality orthodontic care using the latest technology."
